---
import Docs from "../../layouts/Docs.astro";
import { CodeBlock } from "@weed-ui/code-block";
import { withBase, installCmd, registryTemplate } from "../../lib/site";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Docs
  title="安装 · weed docs"
  description="weed-ui 安装指南：单 URL 安装、namespace registry、主题接入与无闪烁 bootstrap。"
>
  <header class="doc-head">
    <p class="w-eyebrow">docs / installation</p>
    <h1 class="doc-title">安装</h1>
  </header>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <p class="w-eyebrow sec-label">01 · single url</p>
    <CodeBlock
      client:visible
      language="BASH"
      filename="~/weed"
      prompt
      code={installCmd("button")}
    />
    <p class="doc-note">
      组件自带主题 token（styles/weed-ui/*.css）、cn()（lib/utils.ts）与 npm 依赖。
      前提：项目已跑 Tailwind CSS v4 并配好 @ alias。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <p class="w-eyebrow sec-label">02 · namespace</p>
    <p class="doc-note">装三个以上再用这个。在 components.json 里加 registry：</p>
    <CodeBlock
      client:visible
      language="JSON"
      filename="components.json"
      code={`{
  "registries": {
    "@weed-ui": "${registryTemplate}"
  }
}`}
    />
    <CodeBlock
      client:visible
      language="BASH"
      filename="~/weed"
      prompt
      code={`npx shadcn add @weed-ui/button
npx shadcn add @weed-ui/tabs @weed-ui/dialog`}
    />
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <p class="w-eyebrow sec-label">03 · theme</p>
    <CodeBlock
      client:visible
      language="CSS"
      filename="app/globals.css"
      code={`@import "tailwindcss";
@import "./styles/weed-ui/tailwind.css";   /* 或把 @theme 映射写进你的 globals */
@import "./styles/weed-ui/tokens.css";
@import "./styles/weed-ui/fonts.css";
@import "./styles/weed-ui/blueprint.css";`}
    />
    <p class="doc-note">
      字体文件自管：Departure Mono（SIL OFL，不在 fontsource/Google Fonts，从
      <a href="https://github.com/rektdeckard/departure-mono/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub releases</a>
      下载 woff2 并随附许可文件）；Source Serif 4 用
      <code class="doc-chip">@fontsource-variable/source-serif-4</code>。中文走系统黑体，无需额外字体。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <p class="w-eyebrow sec-label">04 · no-flash bootstrap</p>
    <p class="doc-note">
      token 由 <code class="doc-chip">&lt;html data-theme="dark|light"&gt;</code>
      驱动。把这段内联进 <code class="doc-chip">&lt;head&gt;</code>，首帧即正确主题
      （存过偏好则跟随偏好，否则跟随系统）：
    </p>
    <CodeBlock
      client:visible
      language="JS"
      filename="layout head (inline)"
      code={`<script>
  (function () {
    var t;
    try { t = localStorage.getItem("weed-theme"); } catch (e) {}
    if (t !== "light" && t !== "dark") {
      t = window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: light)")
        .matches ? "light" : "dark";
    }
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
  })();
</script>`}
    />
    <p class="doc-note">
      然后放上 <a href={withBase("/docs/components/theme-toggle")}>ThemeToggle</a>，完事。
      深浅主题语义 token 全覆盖，组件层零改动。
    </p>
  </section>
</Docs>

<style>
  .doc-head {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .doc-title {
    font-family: var(--w-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--w-text-2xl);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
  }
  .doc-section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .sec-label {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .doc-section .code-block {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .doc-note {
    font-family: var(--w-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--w-text-xs);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin: 10px 0 12px;
    line-height: var(--w-leading-prose);
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .doc-note a {
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .doc-chip {
    font-family: var(--w-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--w-text-xs);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--panel-soft);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
</style>
